Third-party assets

The MIT License above covers the source code. Some files under assets/ come
from third parties and keep their own terms:

- assets/characters/*/  3D models generated with Tencent Hunyuan3D (or TripoSR
  for the robot). Models made with Hunyuan3D fall under the Tencent Hunyuan 3D
  Community License, which among other things does not cover use in the EU,
  the UK or South Korea. Read each folder's LICENSE.md before any commercial
  use or redistribution.
- assets/mocap/  Clips from the CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database. See
  assets/mocap/LICENSE.md.
